WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
One team. One visual memory.
Turn judgement into a spec your whole team can use.

00:08.500 --> 00:12.000
Make good judgement repeatable.
References, component requirements, and exemplars share one version.

00:12.000 --> 00:28.000
One method supports many visual languages.
The director defines form, material, brushwork, and hierarchy for each project.

00:28.000 --> 00:49.000
One project baseline becomes focused production briefs.
Characters, items, UI, VFX, match, puzzle, and tabletop work each get a template.

00:49.000 --> 00:55.000
Review a representative first piece before scaling.
Four team lanes start from the same project version.

00:55.000 --> 01:04.000
Review style, identity, task, and technical requirements separately.
Turn feedback into something the team can fix.

01:04.000 --> 01:10.000
Keep the judgement. Carry the work forward.
